[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614629831","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102061#issuecomment-2614629831","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102061","id":2614629831,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b2BXH","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-26T23:17:56Z","updated_at":"2025-01-26T23:17:56Z","body":"By \"user\" args, it means arguments that are ignored by the engine internals so you can pass `-- --fullscreen` without automatically triggering the fullscreen mode, for example. However, you are still passing the user arguments to the editor, which is a separate process from the project's run instance. You get them if you execute code in the editor with a tool script.\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Node\n\nfunc _ready():\n\tprint(\"args: %s\" % OS.get_cmdline_args())\n\t# Will print the user args when executed in the editor but not when executed in the run instance.\n\tprint(\"user args: %s\" % OS.get_cmdline_user_args())\n```\n\n> how can I debug a run with specific user args?\n\n`Debug > Customize Run Instances > Main Run Args`. You can also put `--` there but if you aren't passing arguments with the same name as the engine's arguments like `fullscreen` or `path`, you probably don't need it and can use `get_cmdline_args()` instead of `get_cmdline_user_args()`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614629831/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616608546","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102061#issuecomment-2616608546","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102061","id":2616608546,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b9kci","user":{"login":"Arkmut","id":11788055,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzg4MDU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11788055?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arkmut","html_url":"https://github.com/Arkmut","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arkmut/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arkmut/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arkmut/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arkmut/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arkmut/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arkmut/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arkmut/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arkmut/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arkmut/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T18:39:57Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T18:39:57Z","body":"Ok thanks, it works like a charm. Should I close the issue then?","author_association":"NONE","pin":